WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 10</i>

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.870
We need to seize our opportunity
 during the birthday celebrations.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:51.250
Tomorrow, I will use trade between 
our two nations as an excuse

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.140
to persuade His Imperial Majesty 
to open up towns near the border.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:57.200
If this scheme works,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.140
you and I will coordinate from both outside 
and inside these towns when the time comes.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.710
But if we move too hastily,

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.400
Ye Youming and his faction will 
not let us have our way easily.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.500
Do not fret.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.700
The empress dowager has 
always disliked Ye Youming.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.270
If an argument ensues, she will take our side.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:29.270
Shang'er, how can you forget 
your place and be so rude?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.700
Where is your gift to the princess? 
Why have you not presented one?

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.640
Was your greedy mouth all you brought?

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.560
As if.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:40.050
I have a gift right here to 
present to Princess Lanshuang.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.290
The princess definitely 
won't guess what it is.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.490
I'm not interested in guessing, either.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.190
Shang'er, you are too discourteous.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.510
His Imperial Majesty has loved Princess
Lanshuang dearly since she was little.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.140
What treasure would she not have seen before?

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.850
What right do you have to spout such nonsense?

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.140
What nonsense?

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.790
Behave yourself!

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.600
Did you forgot the rules and rituals
 we taught you after you married?

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:10.720
Enough!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.580
This is the princess' birthday party.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:17.970
How dare the two of you argue 
about such trivial matters here!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.860
I am a little curious about your gift.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.100
Hurry up and present it.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.350
My gift to the princess is a garland.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.600
A garland? Seriously?

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.950
Since marrying Prince Ye, you have 
become ignorant of the rules of etiquette.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.100
How dare you present such a pathetic gift!

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:44.970
Not only do you embarrass Prince Ye, 
you embarrass me also.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:46.330
You...

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.430
As a proud prince, I do not require 
my princess to bring gifts herself.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.950
I did not expect your daughter to bring a gift.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:58.290
Based on her sincerity alone, 
how could our vulgar gifts even compare?

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.810
<i><i>At least you thought of me, Prince Jerk.</i></i>

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.160
Yes, but—

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:09.990
Besides, Grand Councilor and his wife are 
disrupting the occasion with this fracas.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:14.060
It makes one wonder who is 
the "discourteous" one here...

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:23.360
I am delighted that His Highness
 spoils my daughter so.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:27.250
However, given His Highness'
 noble and special status,

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.620
and the important military duties His 
Imperial Majesty has bestowed on him,

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.200
I believe His Highness should be more
 careful with his speech and behavior.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.430
He has, after all, disregarded the 
rules of etiquette and morals.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.040
Is such behavior appropriate?

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.680
<i><i>It seems like I've made
 trouble for Prince Jerk...</i></i>

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.700
Ye'er...

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.230
It was indeed Princess Ye
 who talked back first.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:05:00.000
You may spoil her, but you cannot disregard
seniority and seriousness in these matters.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.060
I am worried that you will fail to
meet your father's expectations.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:07.810
Grandmother, Brother did 
not mean it in that way.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.810
I am speaking to Ye'er right now.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.270
Grandmother, please don't blame my brothers.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.830
I actually really like this garland.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.370
It is pure and refined, 
with a fresh fragrance.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.140
These...

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.990
Are these flowers Jizi orchids?

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.290
Jizi orchids?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.390
This orchid blooms once every 300 years, 
and is extremely difficult to grow.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.030
<i>Every 300 years?</i>

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.800
It is a very delicate flower.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:53.640
Furthermore, only a truly refined person 
may earn the right to nurture this flower.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:05:59.930
Where are these butterflies from?

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:04.230
They are likely attracted by 
the fragrance of the Jizi orchid.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:16.600
I have yearned for this flower, ever since 
I saw its picture in a book many years ago.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:22.390
At that time, your grandfather 
was given a plant by a hermit.

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.200
After careful nurturing, buds appeared.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.390
Despite this, I had still never had 
the chance to see it in full bloom.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:37.580
Today is the day my beloved 
granddaughter comes of age.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:43.410
This precious and rare Jizi orchid
becomes my Shuang'er perfectly.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.140
Excellent. We thank you for 
your kindness, Princess Ye.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.640
I find it hard to believe you found time 
to prepare the perfect gift for Lanshuang

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.360
while locked in the firewood storehouse.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.710
But the Princess Palace does not have this 
type of flower. Where did you acquire it?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.140
Through legal means.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:13.640
They can even grow Jizi orchids. 
The Ye Princely Palace is wondrous.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.520
His Imperial Majesty's ability 
to spot talent is unquestionable.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:19.950
All right. Let the banquet begin!

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.890
The banquet begins!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.720
Here, Lord Ji.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.020
To your health, Grand Councilor.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.770
Lord Beitang, do you enjoy 
the food of the Central Plains?

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:02.150
The Central Plains are vast, 
abundant with food and the like.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:07.000
This plum wine from the north and lychee soup
 from the south can share the same table.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.040
It has broadened my horizons.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.220
However, the lychees could be fresher.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:17.110
If you had faster horses to transport them...

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:24.350
Your Imperial Majesty, we have many 
products, and they have good horses.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:29.670
Why not each take what we need from the other,
and create trading posts at the border?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:35.000
This way, not only will it grow our
 economy, it will increase our GDP.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.100
Would it not kill two birds with one stone?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.100
Good horses...

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:44.790
Now that the West has shown its intention for 
peace, which it has expressed most sincerely,

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.720
I believe we should not pass up
 such a golden opportunity.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.580
Your Imperial Majesty, the border 
towns are important military sites.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.320
Opening trading posts is not 
some game. Please think twice!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:00.370
Your concerns are sensible 
ones, General Xuan.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:04.320
However, such isolationist policies
 are not a long-term solution.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:10.470
Or is this a sign that you do not believe you can
 defend our nation and its people, General Xuan?

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.360
But...

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:18.720
In order to promote this trade deal,
we are willing to provide our best stallions.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.260
All right. After the banquet,

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:26.100
please come to the Imperial Palace to 
discuss this matter in detail, Lord Beitang.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.020
My thanks, Imperial Majesty.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.810
Congratulations, Father, on reaching a 
preliminary agreement with Lord Beitang.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.790
However, if we are talking horses,

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:38.290
I have bred a number of stallions recently,

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.060
and they are more than 
a match for those in the West.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.560
Oh? Stallions better than the West's?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.430
As everyone knows, the horses from 
the West are the best of the best.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.560
Are you sure your confidence 
is not unfounded, Highness?

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.120
In that case, let us have a race.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.930
We will find out who breeds 
the best horses in the world.

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:10.430
What an interesting turn of
 events! You have my blessing!

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.180
Do not be impulsive.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.560
Something wrong? You fear 
you will lose, Lord Beitang?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:27.020
Since the invitation is from Your 
Highness, how can I not accept?

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.600
Perfect. Allow me to give you some
advice about riding, Your Highness.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:31.500
No.

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.560
I am not the one you will be competing against.

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:36.430
It will be her.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.290
What? Princess Ye?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.060
Asking the princess to 
compete in a horse race?

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.330
Your Highness, surely you jest?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.820
Does it look like I am?

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:01.410
<i>What the heck is Prince Jerk thinking?</i>

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.220
Father.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:09.100
The horses I breed can beat Lord Beitang's
 even when ridden by a rider without skill.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.220
This will prove they are the best in the world.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:18.330
All right. I will judge your contest today.

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.560
My thanks, Father.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.060
Servants! Bring my horse.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.560
Come on! You can do it!

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.560
Seriously?!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:48.090
That is the horse raised by Prince Ye.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:50.200
What an extraordinary beast!

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:02.330
<i>So it's you, Juliet!</i>

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.480
<i>It's been a while, my Romeo. </i>

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.620
<i>Are you going to ride me today?</i>

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:13.830
I witnessed it. Succubus behaved 
like a rabbit in her presence.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.050
Interesting.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.140
This is the horse?

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.720
Yes, this is one of the stallions I have bred.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:29.720
How does it compare to your 
Thousand Miles Snow Hoof, Lord Beitang?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:42.470
You never mentioned 
Ye Youming had a Red Dragon Foal.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.100
I told you not to be impulsive.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.470
We will begin when you are ready.

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:53.140
Riders Princess Ye and Lord Beitang. 
Please mount your horses.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.690
<i>A Red Dragon Foal versus 
a Thousand Miles Snow Hoof. </i>

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.720
<i>It is hard to say which will win. </i>

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:06.380
If Ye Youming wins and gains the 
upper hand, our plans will be dashed.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.240
The higher the risk, the better the reward.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.430
Ye Youming has been nothing but aggressive.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:16.860
This could be a good opportunity for us.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.870
Lord Beitang, do you intend to...

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.910
Ye Youming is not the only one 
who came well-prepared.

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.390
What's going on?

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.430
The heavens have opened!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.670
Help the masters to the hallway
 to shelter from the rain.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.140
My birthday party...

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:08.180
Oh dear. It seems the 
weather is not cooperating.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.310
Imperial Majesty, 
deciding which border towns

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:15.140
to use as trading posts
requires careful consideration.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:21.560
Since the rain is heavy, why not come
 to my house so we can discuss it?

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:26.780
Please don't go, Father. Today is my birthday.

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:28.770
Anyone who leaves early is a meanie.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.110
She is right, Father.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.660
If everyone departs, who shall 
keep Lanshuang company?

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:38.520
Indeed. Has Grand Councilor even 
considered how the princess would feel?

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.290
It is my fault for not 
considering that aspect.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.390
I hope Her Highness will forgive me.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:49.020
But as it is raining heavily, there seems 
little hope of the banquet continuing.

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:52.390
No! No!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.290
I spent more than a month
 preparing this banquet.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.870
I don't want it to end like this!

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:58.520
Shuang'er...

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:02.000
A storm may appear from 
a cloudless sky, Her Highness.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.510
We cannot fight the weather.

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:06.640
That's what you think.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.540
The weather won't change, but people can.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.460
It's only drizzling. There are
 many solutions to this problem.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.110
What do you plan to do?

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.350
How many red silks like the 
ones on that tree do we have?

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.700
We have a lot in the 
storehouse still, Your Highness.

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.950
And roller blinds?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.140
We have plenty.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.870
Please bring some over here.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.640
Yes, Highness.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.640
What is Princess Ye planning to do?

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:47.890
What do you plan to do this time?

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.140
You want to know, Highness?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.220
Tell me.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:52.980
I'm not telling.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.900
Your Highness, is this enough?

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:04.070
Is there anything else you need us to fetch?

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:06.960
Let me see...

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.600
It seems like something's still missing.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:15.390
There are pebbles around the 
corner of the hallway. Fetch some.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.890
<i><i>Does he know what I'm going to do? </i></i>

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.660
<i><i>So he just pretended not to know?</i></i>

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.060
<i><i>This guy's despicable.</i></i>
